{"id":3108,"date":"2025-12-01T12:55:32","date_gmt":"2025-12-01T12:55:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=3108"},"modified":"2026-02-14T23:24:40","modified_gmt":"2026-02-14T23:24:40","slug":"cardboard-cosmetic-jar-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-cosmetic-jar-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Cosmetic Jar Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"45\">Cardboard Cosmetic Jar Boxes For Daily Use<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"47\" data-end=\"677\">Cardboard cosmetic jar boxes help skincare and beauty brands keep jars protected, arranged, and easier to handle from the packing bench to the retail shelf. Many teams that already use <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-perfume-sleeve-boxes\/\"><strong>Cardboard Perfume Sleeve Boxes<\/strong><\/a> for fragrance lines keep a similar cardboard look when planning jar packaging. These boxes hold clay masks, balms, creams, serums, and spa products by keeping jars in a fitted space that limits movement. Board strength helps keep containers upright so labels remain visible in display units and inside shipping cartons. This matters for shops, online sellers, and spa studios that handle orders and restocking on busy days.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"1274\">The structure works across small and large jars, allowing brands to use one packaging family across multiple jar sizes. Smooth outer walls provide space for branding, directions, and ingredient notes without crowding panels. Inside, simple inserts or padding can be added for glass jars when additional separation is needed, especially on longer courier routes. Cardboard cosmetic jar boxes wholesale runs help businesses keep sizes and colours consistent across batches. When the same shapes and board types repeat over time, presentation stays consistent, and handling routines stay predictable.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1328\">Protection Benefits For Jars In Regular Handling<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1784\">Cosmetic jars often need more than a basic sleeve when they are stacked in stockrooms, shipped in bulk, or handled on store floors. Cardboard jar boxes form a firm shell around the container, which can reduce scuffs and surface scratches when units contact each other. The walls guide jars into the same position, which helps labels face forward on shelves and inside gift sets. This supports consistent placement when multiple variants sit side by side.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2294\"><strong data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2294\">Key Advantages Of Cosmetic Jar Box Packaging<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2785\">\n<li data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2362\">\n<p data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2362\">Helps glass and plastic jars stay steady in storage and transit<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2363\" data-end=\"2420\">\n<p data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2420\">Reduces surface marks so printed labels stay readable<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2421\" data-end=\"2480\">\n<p data-start=\"2423\" data-end=\"2480\">Supports front-facing placement on shelves and displays<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2554\">\n<p data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2554\">Keeps outer appearance consistent across multiple jar sizes and lines<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2555\" data-end=\"2614\">\n<p data-start=\"2557\" data-end=\"2614\">Works with simple inner padding for delicate containers<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2615\" data-end=\"2674\">\n<p data-start=\"2617\" data-end=\"2674\">Supports quick packing while keeping the structure firm<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2675\" data-end=\"2730\">\n<p data-start=\"2677\" data-end=\"2730\">Fits common use in beauty, spa, and wellness retail<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2731\" data-end=\"2785\">\n<p data-start=\"2733\" data-end=\"2785\">Works for individual jars and small treatment sets<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2838\"><strong data-start=\"2787\" data-end=\"2838\">Practical Uses For Buyers Of Cosmetic Jar Boxes<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li data-start=\"2841\" data-end=\"2922\">Packing daily skincare items in matched cardboard formats for stores and salons<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2995\">Building packaging for online orders with a consistent outer structure<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2998\" data-end=\"3087\">Supporting cosmetic packaging boxes wholesale programs with repeatable sizes and colours<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3090\" data-end=\"3163\">Creating sampler sets where several smaller jars share one outer format<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3166\" data-end=\"3241\">Packing glass-based formulas that need separation from impact and rubbing<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3244\" data-end=\"3319\">Presenting spa and clinic products in an organised way at reception desks<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3322\" data-end=\"3389\">Packing seasonal collections while keeping the same box structure<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3392\" data-end=\"3469\">Supplying subscription skincare boxes that need consistent outer protection<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"4318\">\n<thead data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3597\">\n<tr data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3597\">\n<th data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3485\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3484\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3485\" data-end=\"3498\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"3487\" data-end=\"3497\">Detail<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3521\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3500\" data-end=\"3520\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3521\" data-end=\"3545\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3544\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3545\" data-end=\"3572\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3547\" data-end=\"3571\">Add Ons And Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"3572\" data-end=\"3597\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"3574\" data-end=\"3595\">Usage Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"4318\">\n<tr data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3816\">\n<td data-start=\"3624\" data-end=\"3644\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Jar compatibility<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3644\" data-end=\"3692\" data-col-size=\"md\">Holds small, medium, and larger jars in place<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3692\" data-end=\"3722\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft, SBS, rigid cardboard<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3722\" data-end=\"3749\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte, gloss, soft touch<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3749\" data-end=\"3781\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Inner pads or folded supports<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3781\" data-end=\"3816\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Everyday skincare and spa lines<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3985\">\n<td data-start=\"3817\" data-end=\"3833\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Wall strength<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3833\" data-end=\"3877\" data-col-size=\"md\">Resists dents and compression around jars<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3877\" data-end=\"3905\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated or dense board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3930\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth protective coat<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3930\" data-end=\"3955\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Extra board at corners<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3955\" data-end=\"3985\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Retail storage and transit<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"3986\" data-end=\"4154\">\n<td data-start=\"3986\" data-end=\"3999\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Brand area<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"3999\" data-end=\"4042\" data-col-size=\"md\">Space for art, benefits, and ingredients<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4042\" data-end=\"4064\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Coated board stocks<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4064\" data-end=\"4099\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Solid colors or gentle gradients<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4099\" data-end=\"4118\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Clear logo zones<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4118\" data-end=\"4154\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Beauty counters and online packs<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4318\">\n<td data-start=\"4155\" data-end=\"4174\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Protection level<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4209\" data-col-size=\"md\">Helps limit scuffs and vibration<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4209\" data-end=\"4235\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Thick fibre-based board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4235\" data-end=\"4256\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Even outer surface<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4256\" data-end=\"4280\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Optional inner lining<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4318\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Shipping units and courier parcels<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 data-start=\"4320\" data-end=\"4372\">Lidded Cosmetic Jar Packaging For Skincare Lines<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"4374\" data-end=\"4923\">Lidded cardboard cosmetic jar boxes give creams, masks, and scrubs an extra layer of cover above the jar, which can be useful for storage and retail display. Many product developers planning new sets look at <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/Cosmetic-and-Gift-Cardboard-Boxes\/\"><strong>Cosmetic and Gift Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> to keep jar packaging aligned with kits and other presentation packs. The lid adds a covered top surface and provides additional print area while reducing contact with dust and shelf marks. This format is used for spa collections, skincare jars, and wellness gift sets where a lidded structure is preferred.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4925\" data-end=\"5405\">Because the lid and base work together as a single structure, the jar is supported from multiple sides. This reduces rolling and supports label orientation when boxes are opened at counters or in recorded demonstrations. Lidded cardboard cosmetic jar boxes wholesale runs help brands keep the same format across skincare families, such as face creams, masks, treatment balms, and overnight products. A consistent format helps keep packing steps the same across different products.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"5407\" data-end=\"5457\">Display And Shipping Gains From Lidded Formats<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"5459\" data-end=\"5867\">A firm lid adds coverage during long-distance shipping and stacked storage. By covering the top of the jar and closing the base, the box reduces direct contact with the container during small bumps and handling. This is useful for heavier glass jars that may move through multiple hubs before reaching a customer. The top surface also provides space for logos, product names, and short product statements.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"6317\" data-end=\"6366\"><strong data-start=\"6317\" data-end=\"6366\">Advantages Of Using Lidded Cosmetic Jar Boxes<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"6367\" data-end=\"6839\">\n<li data-start=\"6367\" data-end=\"6429\">\n<p data-start=\"6369\" data-end=\"6429\">Supports jar positioning by covering containers from above<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6430\" data-end=\"6494\">\n<p data-start=\"6432\" data-end=\"6494\">Provides a top surface for logos, names, and key information<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6495\" data-end=\"6552\">\n<p data-start=\"6497\" data-end=\"6552\">Helps reduce dust contact and shelf marks on jar caps<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6553\" data-end=\"6620\">\n<p data-start=\"6555\" data-end=\"6620\">Makes stacking more predictable in storage and shipping cartons<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6621\" data-end=\"6673\">\n<p data-start=\"6623\" data-end=\"6673\">Creates a consistent line across retail fixtures<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6674\" data-end=\"6733\">\n<p data-start=\"6676\" data-end=\"6733\">Works with small leaflets or cards placed above the jar<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6734\" data-end=\"6785\">\n<p data-start=\"6736\" data-end=\"6785\">Supports single items and curated skincare sets<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6786\" data-end=\"6839\">\n<p data-start=\"6788\" data-end=\"6839\">Fits into broader beauty and gift packaging plans<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"6841\" data-end=\"6897\"><strong data-start=\"6841\" data-end=\"6897\">Common Situations Where Lidded Jar Boxes Are Helpful<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li data-start=\"6900\" data-end=\"6965\">Packing skincare kits where each jar needs its own secure space<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"6968\" data-end=\"7043\">Running cardboard cosmetic jar boxes, bulk orders for steady retail supply<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7046\" data-end=\"7110\">Building jar-based gift sets for spa chains and beauty lounges<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7113\" data-end=\"7160\">Sending heavier jars through courier networks<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7163\" data-end=\"7233\">Presenting lines where multiple pack faces carry printed information<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7236\" data-end=\"7310\">Supporting online subscriptions where jars are opened and stored at home<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7313\" data-end=\"7388\">Aligning packaging across jar, bottle, and tube formats in the same range<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"7391\" data-end=\"7455\">Creating seasonal sets while keeping core dimensions unchanged<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"7457\" data-end=\"8321\">\n<thead data-start=\"7457\" data-end=\"7583\">\n<tr data-start=\"7457\" data-end=\"7583\">\n<th data-start=\"7457\" data-end=\"7471\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"7459\" data-end=\"7470\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"7471\" data-end=\"7484\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"7473\" data-end=\"7483\">Detail<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"7484\" data-end=\"7507\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"7486\" data-end=\"7506\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"7507\" data-end=\"7531\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"7509\" data-end=\"7530\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"7531\" data-end=\"7558\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"7533\" data-end=\"7557\">Add-ons and Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"7558\" data-end=\"7583\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"7560\" data-end=\"7581\">Usage Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"7610\" data-end=\"8321\">\n<tr data-start=\"7610\" data-end=\"7777\">\n<td data-start=\"7610\" data-end=\"7623\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lid design<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7623\" data-end=\"7662\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Smooth top cover that closes cleanly<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7662\" data-end=\"7686\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft or coated board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7686\" data-end=\"7713\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte, gloss, soft touch<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7713\" data-end=\"7742\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Neat lid edges or soft lip<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7742\" data-end=\"7777\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Beauty shelves and spa displays<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"7778\" data-end=\"7951\">\n<td data-start=\"7778\" data-end=\"7793\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Jar security<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7793\" data-end=\"7826\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Limits movement inside the box<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7826\" data-end=\"7859\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Thick cardboard or rigid board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7859\" data-end=\"7883\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Anti-scuff outer coat<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7883\" data-end=\"7915\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cut-out slots or collar rings<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7915\" data-end=\"7951\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Shipping units and online orders<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"7952\" data-end=\"8130\">\n<td data-start=\"7952\" data-end=\"7972\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Print flexibility<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"7972\" data-end=\"8010\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Provides a broad area for brand art<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8010\" data-end=\"8033\" data-col-size=\"sm\">SBS and dense boards<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8033\" data-end=\"8059\" data-col-size=\"sm\">CMYK or selected colours<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8059\" data-end=\"8094\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Foil work or subtly raised marks<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8094\" data-end=\"8130\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Cosmetic brands and launch lines<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"8131\" data-end=\"8321\">\n<td data-start=\"8131\" data-end=\"8150\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Capacity options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8150\" data-end=\"8191\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Supports one or multiple jars in a set<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8191\" data-end=\"8218\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strong fibre-based board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8218\" data-end=\"8252\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Light lamination where required<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8252\" data-end=\"8284\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Dividers and inner partitions<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"8284\" data-end=\"8321\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Skincare kits and curated bundles<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h2 data-start=\"8323\" data-end=\"8374\">Multi Jar Cardboard Sets For Beauty Collections<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"8376\" data-end=\"8820\">Large cardboard cosmetic jar boxes support spa sets, multi-jar kits, organic skincare bundles, and gift assortments. Brands that manage daily shipping routines often work with <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><strong>Cardboard Boxes Wholesale<\/strong><\/a>, so jar collections use related board types across inner packs and outer cartons. Multi-jar boxes provide space to arrange jars in clear sections while keeping items under one lid. This supports set building with a consistent layout when opened.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"8822\" data-end=\"9240\">The interior can be planned with partitions, foam layers, or card inserts to hold each jar in its own position. This reduces container contact during longer delivery routes or repeated handling at events.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"9242\" data-end=\"9293\">Handling Advantages Of Larger Multi-Jar Layouts<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"9295\" data-end=\"9679\">Multi-jar packaging needs to be easy to load for staff and stable to carry. A wider base and firmer side walls allow jars to sit in an organised pattern without narrow gaps or overlap. This supports both front-of-house teams building gift sets and warehouse teams preparing bulk orders. External wraps or carry options can be added if sets must be moved by hand over longer distances.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"10116\" data-end=\"10162\"><strong data-start=\"10116\" data-end=\"10162\">Benefits Of Large Multi-Jar Cosmetic Boxes<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"10163\" data-end=\"10701\">\n<li data-start=\"10163\" data-end=\"10228\">\n<p data-start=\"10165\" data-end=\"10228\">Supports a clear arrangement of two or more jars in each layout<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10229\" data-end=\"10287\">\n<p data-start=\"10231\" data-end=\"10287\">Helps teams manage bundle sets with consistent spacing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10288\" data-end=\"10367\">\n<p data-start=\"10290\" data-end=\"10367\">Creates a grid layout that is easy to photograph for online and catalogue use<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10368\" data-end=\"10445\">\n<p data-start=\"10370\" data-end=\"10445\">Keeps packing routines consistent for high-volume sellers and event teams<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10446\" data-end=\"10500\">\n<p data-start=\"10448\" data-end=\"10500\">Reduces jar contact during longer transport routes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10501\" data-end=\"10565\">\n<p data-start=\"10503\" data-end=\"10565\">Works with different insert types for jar shapes and heights<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10566\" data-end=\"10629\">\n<p data-start=\"10568\" data-end=\"10629\">Keeps a firm feel in hand while stacking neatly for storage<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10630\" data-end=\"10701\">\n<p data-start=\"10632\" data-end=\"10701\">Supports everyday sets and higher-density kit formats in one family<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"10703\" data-end=\"10755\"><strong data-start=\"10703\" data-end=\"10755\">Ways Brands Apply Large Cosmetic Jar Box Formats<\/strong><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li data-start=\"10758\" data-end=\"10820\">Building gift sets for spa, hotel, and resort retail corners<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10823\" data-end=\"10899\">Supporting cardboard cosmetic jar boxes wholesale orders for seasonal kits<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10902\" data-end=\"10978\">Packing paper-labelled jars in aligned sections for easy reading on opening<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"10981\" data-end=\"11041\">Organising shipments where sets pass through multiple hubs<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11044\" data-end=\"11116\">Creating limited runs that reuse existing outer sizes with new inserts<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11119\" data-end=\"11190\">Linking jar sets with matching cartons and sleeves in the wider range<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11193\" data-end=\"11256\">Presenting routines such as morning, evening, or weekend care<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"11259\" data-end=\"11332\">Preparing retail testers and staff education kits in protective formats<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"11334\" data-end=\"12212\">\n<thead data-start=\"11334\" data-end=\"11460\">\n<tr data-start=\"11334\" data-end=\"11460\">\n<th data-start=\"11334\" data-end=\"11348\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"11336\" data-end=\"11347\">Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"11348\" data-end=\"11361\" data-col-size=\"md\"><strong data-start=\"11350\" data-end=\"11360\">Detail<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"11361\" data-end=\"11384\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"11363\" data-end=\"11383\">Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"11384\" data-end=\"11408\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"11386\" data-end=\"11407\">Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"11408\" data-end=\"11435\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"11410\" data-end=\"11434\">Add-ons and Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th data-start=\"11435\" data-end=\"11460\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"11437\" data-end=\"11458\">Usage Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"11487\" data-end=\"12212\">\n<tr data-start=\"11487\" data-end=\"11677\">\n<td data-start=\"11487\" data-end=\"11505\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Multi-jar space<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"11505\" data-end=\"11551\" data-col-size=\"md\">Fits two or more jars with clear separation<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"11551\" data-end=\"11582\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Kraft, duplex, rigid options<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"11582\" data-end=\"11609\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Matte, gloss, soft touch<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"11609\" data-end=\"11643\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Card partitions or foam inserts<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"11643\" data-end=\"11677\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Gift sets and bundled routines<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"11678\" data-end=\"11857\">\n<td data-start=\"11678\" data-end=\"11697\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Support strength<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"11697\" data-end=\"11737\" data-col-size=\"md\">Holds the combined weight of several jars<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"11737\" data-end=\"11770\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Corrugated or reinforced board<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"11770\" data-end=\"11795\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Protective outer coats<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"11795\" data-end=\"11822\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strengthened base panels<\/td>\n<td data-start=\"11822\" data-end=\"11857\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Spa products and heavier creams<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr data-start=\"11858\" data-end=\"12034\">\n<td data-start=\"11858\" data-end=\"11875\" data-col-size=\"sm\